证据表明，陆军很早就知道爱荷华州的爆炸风险</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/26/us/iowa-lead-ammunition-stockpile-history.html</link><description>爱荷华州一家工厂的不稳定爆炸物清除工作一年多前就开始了，但当时尚未完成，为周三有争议的爆炸埋下了伏笔。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[纽约时报]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/26/us/iowa-lead-ammunition-stockpile-history.html'&gt;有证据表明，陆军很早就知道爱荷华州的爆炸风险&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：The Army Knew Much Earlier of the Explosive Risk in Iowa, Evidence Suggests&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/26/us/iowa-lead-ammunition-stockpile-history.html</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 16:00:12 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[彭博社] 刚果黄金交易商计划建设两座产能 68 吨的精炼厂</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/congo-gold-trader-plans-two-refineries-with-68-ton-capacity</link><description>刚果民主共和国的国家黄金贸易商计划建造两座产能为 68 吨的精炼厂，因为该国希望遏制走私并从其贵金属储备中获得更多利润。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[彭博社]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/congo-gold-trader-plans-two-refineries-with-68-ton-capacity'&gt;刚果黄金交易商计划建设两座产能 68 吨的精炼厂&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Congo Gold Trader Plans Two Refineries with 68-Ton Capacity&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/congo-gold-trader-plans-two-refineries-with-68-ton-capacity</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 16:15:54 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[彭博社] 华尔街大肆进行套利交易</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/wall-street-se-vuelve-mas-cauteloso-con-el-carry-trade-mwxrpht6</link><description>行动主要针对 20% 的抵抗运动、干预和政治危机。啊霍拉，la volatilidad obliga a repensar una de las maniobras favorites del Mercado。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[彭博社]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/wall-street-se-vuelve-mas-cauteloso-con-el-carry-trade-mwxrpht6'&gt;华尔街大肆进行套利交易&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Wall Street se vuelve más cauteloso con el carry trade&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/wall-street-se-vuelve-mas-cauteloso-con-el-carry-trade-mwxrpht6</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 16:29:26 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[彭博社] 跨石油公司警告持续经营风险未决债务豁免</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/trans-oil-warns-of-going-concern-risk-pending-debt-waiver</link><description>Trans-Oil 集团在违反一项重要出口设施的财务契约后尚未获得豁免，这增加了这家农产品公司的流动性压力。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[彭博社]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/trans-oil-warns-of-going-concern-risk-pending-debt-waiver'&gt;跨石油公司警告持续经营风险未决债务豁免&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Trans-Oil Warns of Going-Concern Risk Pending Debt Waiver&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/trans-oil-warns-of-going-concern-risk-pending-debt-waiver</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 16:39:29 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[彭博社] 随着中国竞争对手的推进，Stellantis 将暂停更多欧洲工厂</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/stellantis-to-pause-more-europe-plants-as-chinese-rivals-advance</link><description>Stellantis NV 计划在未来几周内在欧洲进一步停工，因为该汽车制造商正在努力应对日益激烈的竞争、高成本和某些车型需求疲软的问题。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[彭博社]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/stellantis-to-pause-more-europe-plants-as-chinese-rivals-advance'&gt;随着中国竞争对手的推进，Stellantis 将暂停更多欧洲工厂&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Stellantis to Pause More Europe Plants as Chinese Rivals Advance&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/stellantis-to-pause-more-europe-plants-as-chinese-rivals-advance</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 16:49:16 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[华尔街日报] 随着另一个战时冬天的到来，基辅居民终于要离开了</title><link>https://www.wsj.com/world/as-another-wartime-winter-sets-in-kyiv-residents-weigh-finally-leaving-c76357dc?mod=rss_worldnews</link><description>俄罗斯正在攻击乌克兰的输电线和发电厂，使日常生活成为生存任务。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[华尔街日报]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.wsj.com/world/as-another-wartime-winter-sets-in-kyiv-residents-weigh-finally-leaving-c76357dc?mod=rss_worldnews'&gt;随着另一个战时冬天的到来，基辅居民终于要离开了&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：As Another Wartime Winter Sets In, Kyiv Residents Weigh Finally Leaving&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.wsj.com/world/as-another-wartime-winter-sets-in-kyiv-residents-weigh-finally-leaving-c76357dc?mod=rss_worldnews</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 17:00:00 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>